{#- Who has to verify which assumptions, and which have been verified.
    Unverified assumptions are ordered by who is responsible for them, so
    each person's list is together; those with no one responsible come
    last. -#}
{% set entries = all_assumptions() %}
{% if entries %}
{% set unverified = entries | rejectattr("verified") | list %}
{% set verified = entries | selectattr("verified") | list %}
## Assumption Verification { #section-assumption-verification }

{% if requires_verified_assumptions() %}
This model requires assumptions to be verified before they suppress
threats: until an assumption is verified, the threats it excludes are
reported as findings.
{% else %}
Assumptions suppress the threats they exclude whether or not they have
been verified. To require verification first, set
`tm.requireVerifiedAssumptions = True`.
{% endif %}

{% macro about(a) -%}
{{ link(a.owner) if a.owner else "the whole model" }}
{%- endmacro %}
{% macro effect(a) -%}
{% if a.suppressed %}suppresses {{ a.suppressed | length }} finding{{ "s" if a.suppressed | length != 1 }}{% elif a.pending %}would suppress {{ a.pending | length }} finding{{ "s" if a.pending | length != 1 }}{% endif %}
{%- endmacro %}
### Unverified assumptions { #section-unverified-assumptions }

{% if unverified %}
| Responsible | Assumption | About | Effect |
|-----|--------|-----|-----|
{% for a in (unverified | selectattr("verifier") | sort(attribute="verifier")) + (unverified | rejectattr("verifier") | list) %}
| {{ a.verifier | md_escape if a.verifier else "*No one*" }} | {{ link(a) }} | {{ about(a) }} | {{ effect(a) }} |
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
None: every assumption has been verified.
{% endif %}

### Verified assumptions { #section-verified-assumptions }

{% if verified %}
| Assumption | About | Verified by | On | Effect |
|--------|-----|-----|----|-----|
{% for a in verified %}
| {{ link(a) }} | {{ about(a) }} | {{ a.verifier | md_escape }} | {{ a.verifiedOn or "" }} | {{ effect(a) }} |
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
None.
{% endif %}

{% endif %}
